    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57219506f5822de43b8c7a9d4e6b1e3d, type: 3}
    _line: Oh, that's what it was, huh? Yeah, I'm pretty big on fishing! That's actually
      why I took this class in the first place.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 1
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e643483e11de3ff4d85defdb6bbe7629, type: 3}
    _line: I, uh, figured if I knew a little more about the fish I was catching,
      it'd make things easier for me. I'm not all that good at fishing yet, but I'm
      not throwing in the towel yet.
    _speakerProperties:
